ets\">\n					<span>100+ Pre-built Layouts</span><br>\n					<span>Customize Every Theme Part</span><br>\n					<span>Works With All Themes</span>\n				</div>\n\n			</div>\n			<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/themedesigner.png\" alt=\"Image of theme designer\" width=\"800\">\n			\n		</div>\n	</div>\n\n	\n	<!-- Animations section with pricingpage pricing section Start -->\n	<div class=\"superbthemes-animations-section-wrapper\">\n		<div class=\"content-wrap\">\n			<div class=\"superbthemes-animations-section\">\n				<div class=\"superbthemes-animations-section-column\">\n					<h2>Add Animations to Any Element <span class=\"superbthemes-animations-section-hideformobile\">Easily</span> With 1 Click</h2>\n					<p>Easily add beautiful animations to any element with Superb Addons’ 30+ animation effects. Add animations with just one click, or customize them further with advanced settings. No coding required!</p>\n\n					<div class=\"superb-addons-signup-cta-wrapper\">\n						<a href=\"https://superbthemes.com/pricing/\" class=\"superb-addons-signup-cta-button\">Get Started Now\n							<span>\n								<svg width=\"14\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n									<path d=\"M13.0306 6.53025L8.53063 11.0302C8.38973 11.1711 8.19863 11.2503 7.99938 11.2503C7.80012 11.2503 7.60902 11.1711 7.46813 11.0302C7.32723 10.8893 7.24807 10.6983 7.24807 10.499C7.24807 10.2997 7.32723 10.1086 7.46813 9.96775L10.6875 6.74962H1.5C1.30109 6.74962 1.11032 6.6706 0.96967 6.52995C0.829018 6.3893 0.75 6.19853 0.75 5.99962C0.75 5.80071 0.829018 5.60994 0.96967 5.46929C1.11032 5.32864 1.30109 5.24962 1.5 5.24962H10.6875L7.46937 2.02962C7.32848 1.88872 7.24932 1.69763 7.24932 1.49837C7.24932 1.29911 7.32848 1.10802 7.46937 0.967121C7.61027 0.826225 7.80137 0.74707 8.00062 0.74707C8.19988 0.74707 8.39098 0.826225 8.53187 0.967121L13.0319 5.46712C13.1018 5.53689 13.1573 5.61979 13.1951 5.71106C13.2329 5.80232 13.2523 5.900