 ease of setup. Enjoy hassle free one-click customization & create a beautiful website without coding.</p>\n\n				<div class=\"superb-addons-signup-cta-wrapper\">\n					<a href=\"https://superbthemes.com/wordpress-themes/\" class=\"superb-addons-signup-cta-button\">View All WordPress Themes\n						<span>\n							<svg width=\"14\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n								<path d=\"M13.0306 6.53025L8.53063 11.0302C8.38973 11.1711 8.19863 11.2503 7.99938 11.2503C7.80012 11.2503 7.60902 11.1711 7.46813 11.0302C7.32723 10.8893 7.24807 10.6983 7.24807 10.499C7.24807 10.2997 7.32723 10.1086 7.46813 9.96775L10.6875 6.74962H1.5C1.30109 6.74962 1.11032 6.6706 0.96967 6.52995C0.829018 6.3893 0.75 6.19853 0.75 5.99962C0.75 5.80071 0.829018 5.60994 0.96967 5.46929C1.11032 5.32864 1.30109 5.24962 1.5 5.24962H10.6875L7.46937 2.02962C7.32848 1.88872 7.24932 1.69763 7.24932 1.49837C7.24932 1.29911 7.32848 1.10802 7.46937 0.967121C7.61027 0.826225 7.80137 0.74707 8.00062 0.74707C8.19988 0.74707 8.39098 0.826225 8.53187 0.967121L13.0319 5.46712C13.1018 5.53689 13.1573 5.61979 13.1951 5.71106C13.2329 5.80232 13.2523 5.90016 13.2522 5.99894C13.252 6.09773 13.2324 6.19552 13.1944 6.28669C13.1564 6.37787 13.1007 6.46064 13.0306 6.53025Z\" fill=\"white\"></path>\n							</svg>\n						</span>\n					</a>\n				</div>\n\n			</div>\n\n		</div>\n	</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"superb-addons-two-column-section superb-addons-two-column-section-product-page superb-addons-two-column-section-product-page-superb-addons-intro superb-addons-two-column-section-elementor\" style=\"margin-top:0px;padding-bottom:80px;\">\n	<div class=\"content-wrap\">\n		<div class=\"superb-addons-two-column-section-wrapper\">\n\n			<div class=\"superb-addons-two-column-section-column\">\n				<div class=\"superb-addons-two-column-section-editor\">\n					<div class=\"superb-addons-two-column-section-editor-logo\">\n						<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/gutenberg-logo.png\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\" alt=\"WordPress Elementor logo\">\n					</div>\n					<div class=\"superb-addons-two-column-section-editor-content\">\n						<h4>Trusted by 1+ million users</h4>\n						<div class=\"superb-addons-two-column-section-editor-content-stars\">\n							<img height=\"14\" width=\"80\" src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/img/5-out-of-5-stars-total-rating.svg\" alt=\"Icon stars\">\n							<span>Rated 4.9 of 5</span>\n						</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n				<h2>Everything You Need, Bundled in One Plugin</h2>\n				<p>Our SuperbThemes flagship plugin is an all-in-one solution that unlocks custom blocks, patterns, pre-built pages, animations, Theme Designer, and much more. It works with all WordPress editors and themes, giving you everything you need to build a website.</p>\n\n				<div class=\"superb-addons-signup-cta-wrapper\">\n					<a href=\"https://superbthemes.com/superb-addons/\" class=\"superb-addons-signup-cta-button\">View Superb Addons\n						<span>\n							<svg width=\"14\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n								<path d=\"M13.0306 6.53025L8.53063 11.0302C8.38973 11.1711 8.19863 11.2503 7.99938 11.2503C7.80012 11.2503 7.60902 11.1711 7.46813 11.0302C7.32723 10.8893 7.24807 10.6983 7.24807 10.499C7.24807 10.2997 7.32723 10.1086 7.46813 9.96775L10.6875 6.74962H1.5C1.30109 6.74962 1.11032 6.6706 0.96967 6.52995C0.829018 6.3893 0.75 6.19853 0.75 5.99962C0.75 5.80071 0.829018 5.60994 0.96967 5.46929C1.11032 5.32864 1.30109 5.24962 1.5 5.24962H10.6875L7.46937 2.02962C7.32848 1.88872 7.24932 1.69763 7.24932 1.49837C7.24932 1.29911 7.32848 1.10802 7.46937 0.967121C7.61027 0.826225 7.80137 0.74707 8.00062 0.74707C8.19988 0.74707 8.39098 0.826225 8.53187 0.967121L13.0319 5.46712C13.1018 5.53689 13.1573 5.61979 13.1951 5.71106C13.2329 5.80232 13.2523 5.90016 13.2522 5.99894C13.252 6.09773 13.2324 6.19552 13.1944 6.28669C13.1564 6.37787 13.1007 6.46064 13.0306 6.53025Z\" fill=\"white\"></path>\n							</svg>\n						</span>\n					</a>\n				</div>\n\n			</div>\n\n			<div class=\"superb-addons-two-column-section-column superb-addons-two-column-section-column-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/wp-themes-superb-addons-min.png);\">\n			</div>\n\n		</div>\n	</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"superb-addons-two-column-section superb-addons-two-column-section-elementor\" id=\"benefits\">\n	<div class=\"content-wrap\">\n		<div class=\"superb-addons-two-column-section-wrapper\">\n\n			<div class=\"superb-addons-two-column-section-column superb-addons-two-column-section-column-image features-ecommerce-compatible fp-ecommerce-compat-scale\">\n			</div>\n\n\n			<div class=\"superb-addons-two-column-section-column\">\n				<div class=\"superb-addons-two-column-section-editor\">\n					<div class=\"superb-addons-two-column-section-editor-logo\">\n						<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/e-icon.png\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\" alt=\"eCommerce icon\">\n					</div>\n					<div class=\"superb-addons-two-column-section-editor-content\">\n						<h4>eCommerce Compatibility</h4>\n						<div class=\"superb-addons-two-column-section-editor-content-stars\">\n							<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/img/5-out-of-5-stars-total-rating.svg\" width=\"83\" height=\"15\" alt=\"Trustpilot rating 5 out of 5 stars\">\n							<span>4.9</span>\n						</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n				<h2>Fully Compatible with All eCommerce Solutions</h2>\n				<p>Our products are created with every single eCommerce solution in mind. Whether you’re using WooCommerce, Easy Digital Downloads, or another platform, our products will work perfectly with your setup to support all payment gateways, shipping options, and third-party add-ons. </p>\n				<p>You have the freedom to choose the payment methods that best suit your business. Whether it’s PayPal, Stripe, crypto, or something else, ensuring full eCommerce compatibility.</p>\n\n				<div class=\"superb-addons-signup-cta-wrapper\">\n					<a href=\"https://superbthemes.com/pricing/\" class=\"superb-addons-signup-cta-button\">Get Started Now\n						<span>\n							<svg width=\"14\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n								<path d=\"M13.0306 6.53025L8.53063 11.0302C8.38973 11.1711 8.19863 11.2503 7.99938 11.2503C7.80012 11.2503 7.60902 11.1711 7.46813 11.0302C7.32723 10.8893 7.24807 10.6983 7.24807 10.499C7.24807 10.2997 7.32723 10.1086 7.46813 9.96775L10.6875 6.74962H1.5C1.30109 6.74962 1.11032 6.6706 0.96967 6.52995C0.829018 6.3893 0.75 6.19853 0.75 5.99962C0.75 5.80071 0.829018 5.60994 0.96967 5.46929C1.11032 5.32864 1.30109 5.24962 1.5 5.24962H10.6875L7.46937 2.02962C7.32848 1.88872 7.24932 1.69763 7.24932 1.49837C7.24932 1.29911 7.32848 1.10802 7.46937 0.967121C7.61027 0.826225 7.80137 0.74707 8.00062 0.74707C8.19988 0.74707 8.39098 0.826225 8.53187 0.967121L13.0319 5.46712C13.1018 5.53689 13.1573 5.61979 13.1951 5.71106C13.2329 5.80232 13.2523 5.90016 13.2522 5.99894C13.252 6.09773 13.2324 6.19552 13.1944 6.28669C13.1564 6.37787 13.1007 6.46064 13.0306 6.53025Z\" fill=\"white\"></path>\n							</svg>\n						</span>\n					</a>\n				</div>\n\n			</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n		</div>\n	</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"superb-addons-two-column-section superb-addons-two-column-section-gutenberg features-seo-and-performance-landingpage\" style=\"    background-color: #f6f6f6;\">\n	<div class=\"content-wrap\">\n		<div class=\"superb-addons-two-column-section-wrapper\">\n			<div class=\"superb-addons-two-column-section-column\">\n				<h2>Friendly Support, 7 Days a Week</h2>\n				<p>Our customers consistently tell us that our support is one of the reasons they stick around. Whether it’s a simple how-to question or a bigger issue, our dedicated team is here to assist you. At SuperbThemes, we speak your language with no technical jargon or confusing instructions.</p>\n				<p>We provide plenty of guides and documentation, including detailed step-by-step instructions, so you always have the support you need.</p>\n\n				<div class=\"superb-addons-signup-cta-wrapper\">\n					<a href=\"https://superbthemes.com/pricing/\" class=\"superb-addons-signup-cta-button\">Get Started Now\n						<span>\n							<svg width=\"14\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n								<path d=\"M13.0306 6.53025L8.53063 11.0302C8.38973 11.1711 8.19863 11.2503 7.99938 11.2503C7.80012 11.2503 7.60902 11.1711 7.46813 11.0302C7.32723 10.8893 7.24807 10.6983 7.24807 10.499C7.24807 10.2997 7.32723 10.1086 7.46813 9.96775L10.6875 6.74962H1.5C1.30109 6.74962 1.11032 6.6706 0.96967 6.52995C0.829018 6.3893 0.75 6.19853 0.75 5.99962C0.75 5.80071 0.829018 5.60994 0.96967 5.46929C1.11032 5.32864 1.30109 5.24962 1.5 5.24962H10.6875L7.46937 2.02962C7.32848 1.88872 7.24932 1.69763 7.24932 1.49837C7.24932 1.29911 7.32848 1.10802 7.46937 0.967121C7.61027 0.826225 7.80137 0.74707 8.00062 0.74707C8.19988 0.74707 8.39098 0.826225 8.53187 0.967121L13.0319 5.46712C13.1018 5.53689 13.1573 5.61979 13.1951 5.71106C13.2329 5.80232 13.2523 5.90016 13.2522 5.99894C13.252 6.09773 13.2324 6.19552 13.1944 6.28669C13.1564 6.37787 13.1007 6.46064 13.0306 6.53025Z\" fill=\"white\"></path>\n							</svg>\n						</span>\n					</a>\n				</div>\n\n			</div>\n\n			<div class=\"superb-addons-two-column-section-column bg-purple-desktop-img superb-addons-two-column-section-column-image page-speed-seo-checkmark-img fp-customer-support-scale\" style=\"background-image:url(https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/support-1.png);\">\n			</div>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n</div>\n\n\n  <div class=\"superb-addons-feature-grid\">\n        <div class=\"content-wrap\">\n\n            <div class=\"superb-addons-feature-grid-header\">\n                <h2>WordPress Blocks</h2>\n                <p>Insert new WordPress blocks with one click and experience WordPress like never before.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"superb-addons-feature-grid-layout-preview\">\n                <img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/wordpress-blocks-min.png\" alt=\"Superb addons block preview\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"superb-addons-feature-grid-container\">\n\n                <div class=\"superb-addons-feature-grid-item\">\n                    <img width=\"35\" height=\"35\" src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/img/sa_svg_rating-icon.svg\" alt=\"icon\">\n                    <h3>Rating Block</h3>\n                    <p>Review anything easily with customizable star ratings and rating bars.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"superb-addons-feature-grid-item\">\n                    <img width=\"35\" height=\"35\" src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/img/sa_svg_author-icon.svg\" alt=\"icon\">\n                    <h3>Author Box </h3>\n                    <p>Showcase the author with a customizable About the Author box. Display it anywhere.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"superb-addons-feature-grid-item\">\n                    <img width=\"35\" height=\"35\" src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/img/sa_svg_icon-toc.svg\" alt=\"icon\">\n                    <h3>Table of Contents</h3>\n                    <p>Auto-generate a table of contents box from your headings with this block.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"superb-addons-feature-grid-item\">\n                    <img width=\"35\" height=\"35\" src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/img/sa_svg_recent-posts.svg\" alt=\"icon\">\n                    <h3>Recent Posts</h3>\n                    <p>Display and customize a beautiful recent posts box on any page or widget.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"superb-addons-feature-grid-item\">\n                    <img width=\"35\" height=\"35\" src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/img/sa_svg_google-maps.svg\" alt=\"icon\">\n                    <h3>Google Maps</h3>\n                    <p>Integrate Google Maps easily. Showcase a location with our user-friendly block.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"superb-addons-feature-grid-item\">\n                    <img width=\"35\" height=\"35\" src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/img/sa_svg_cover-image.svg\" alt=\"icon\">\n                    <h3>Cover Image</h3>\n                    <p>Create beautiful headers and hero sections with our cover image block.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"superb-addons-feature-grid-item\">\n                    <img width=\"35\" height=\"35\" src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/img/accordion-icon-purple.svg\" alt=\"Icon\">\n                    <h3>Accordion</h3>\n                    <p>The Accordion block organizes content into collapsible sections, it\'s ideal for FAQs.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"superb-addons-feature-grid-item\">\n                    <img width=\"35\" height=\"35\" src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/img/sa_svg_cta.svg\" alt=\"Icon\">\n                    <h3>Reveal Buttons</h3>\n                    <p>Create coupon reveal buttons. When a user clicks the button, a code is revealed.</p>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"superb-addons-testimonial-section superb-addons-testimonial-section-lp-white\" style=\"background:#f6f6f6;padding-bottom:60px;\">\n	<div class=\"content-wrap\">\n		<div class=\"superb-addons-testimonial-section-header\">\n			<h2>Trusted by Millions of Users <span>For Over 10 Years</span></h2>\n\n			<div class=\"superb-addons-testimonial-section-header-kpi\">\n				<ul>\n					<li><img width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/checkmark.png\" alt=\"checkmark\"><span>Est. 2014</span></li>\n					<li><img width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/checkmark.png\" alt=\"checkmark\"><span>Rated 4.9/5</span></li>\n					<li><img width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/checkmark.png\" alt=\"checkmark\"><span>Outstanding Support</span></li>\n				</ul>\n			</div>\n			<div class=\"superb-addons-testimonial-section-review-wrapper\">\n\n\n\n\n				<div class=\"superb-addons-testimonial-section-review-item\">\n					<img class=\"superb-addons-testimonial-section-review-item-author-image\" src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/f8bd9ea3dee08f7ba85321d51258246e3eeabc51a618960fb459df09ae75aeea.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" alt=\"Reviewer image\">\n					<h3>Natalie B. <img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/blue-checkmark.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" alt=\"Checkmark\"></h3>\n					<span class=\"superb-addons-testimonial-section-review-item-author-verified\">Business Owner</span>\n					<div class=\"superb-addons-testimonial-section-review-item-stars\">\n						<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/img/5-out-of-5-stars-total-rating.svg\" width=\"100\" height=\"18\" alt=\"Trustpilot rating 5 out of 5 stars\">\n					</div>\n					<p>“I do not have a web design background. No training required. SuperbThemes is intuitive. I would definitely recommend it for small business owners, like myself, who want a website that looks professional.”</p>\n				</div>\n\n\n				<div class=\"superb-addons-testimonial-section-review-item\">\n					<img class=\"superb-addons-testimonial-section-review-item-author-image\" src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/andrea-neil.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" alt=\"Reviewer image\">\n					<h3>Andrea Neil <img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/blue-checkmark.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" alt=\"Checkmark\"></h3>\n					<span class=\"superb-addons-testimonial-section-review-item-author-verified\">Blogger &amp; Author</span>\n					<div class=\"superb-addons-testimonial-section-review-item-stars\">\n						<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/img/5-out-of-5-stars-total-rating.svg\" width=\"100\" height=\"18\" alt=\"Trustpilot rating 5 out of 5 stars\">\n					</div>\n					<p>“I\'m one of those \"creative people,\" so the last thing I want to worry about is figuring out how to add to code. Superb works perfectly for what I need and allows me to easily customize how my site looks.</p>\n					<p>My website loads fast. The customer service has been excellent—something I really appreciate. SuperbThemes is... superb!”</p>\n				</div>\n\n				<div class=\"superb-addons-testimonial-section-review-item\">\n					<img class=\"superb-addons-testimonial-section-review-item-author-image\" src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/48599404684.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" alt=\"Reviewer image\">\n					<h3>Lance D. <img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/blue-checkmark.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" alt=\"Checkmark\"></h3>\n					<span class=\"superb-addons-testimonial-section-review-item-author-verified\">Freelance Web Designer</span>\n					<div class=\"superb-addons-testimonial-section-review-item-stars\">\n						<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/img/5-out-of-5-stars-total-rating.svg\" width=\"100\" height=\"18\" alt=\"Trustpilot rating 5 out of 5 stars\">\n					</div>\n					<p>“I\'ve built at least 100 WordPress sites over the years. SuperbThemes is a company I wouldn\'t hesitate to recommend purchasing from and working with. Great value & outstanding service.”</p>\n				</div>\n\n\n			</div>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"superbthemes_product_landingpage_features_section fse_superbthemes_product_landingpage_features_section\">\n	<div class=\"content-wrap\">\n		<div class=\"superbthemes_product_landingpage_features_section_wrapper fse_superbthemes_product_landingpage_features_section_wrapper\">\n			<div class=\"superbthemes_product_landingpage_features_section_description\">\n				<h2>Unlock Premium Features</h2>\n				<p class=\"superbthemes_product_landingpage_features_section_description_tagline\">Take full advantage of the premium features and create a beautiful website easily, no coding required.</p>\n\n				<div class=\"superbthemes_product_landingpage_features_section_content_features fse_superbthemes_product_landingpage_features_section_content_features\">\n\n					<div class=\"superbthemes_product_landingpage_features_section_content_features_item\">\n						<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/img/fse-icon-seo.svg\" alt=\"Free traffic\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">\n						<h3>Get Free Traffic</h3>\n						<p>Get free traffic by ranking #1 on Google with our lightning-fast & SEO-optimized themes.</p>\n					</div>\n					<div class=\"superbthemes_product_landingpage_features_section_content_features_item\">\n						<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/img/fse-icon-design.svg\" alt=\"1-Click Design\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">\n						<h3>1-Click Design</h3>\n						<p>Don\'t feel like designing your own website? Our themes offer 1-click website design import.</p>\n					</div>\n					<div class=\"superbthemes_product_landingpage_features_section_content_features_item\">\n						<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/img/fse-icon-pencil.svg\" alt=\"Customize\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">\n						<h3>Customize Everything</h3>\n						<p>Make your website unique to fit your brand. Customize everything from colors to fonts.</p>\n					</div>\n					<div class=\"superbthemes_product_landingpage_features_section_content_features_item\">\n						<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/img/fse-icon-support.svg\" alt=\"Support\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">\n						<h3>World-class Support</h3>\n						<p>Amazing customer support is our #1 priority. We do everything we can to help as fast as possible.</p>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n			</div>\n\n			<div class=\"superbthemes_product_landingpage_features_section_img fse_superbthemes_product_landingpage_features_section_img_fse_theme_preview\">\n				<div class=\"superbthemes_product_landingpage_features_section_content_img\">\n					<div class=\"fse_superbthemes_product_landingpage_features_section_img_fse_theme_preview_content_img_inner\" style=\"padding: 0px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0);\">\n						<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/creativity-hub-assets-editor-image-1.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Core features\">\n					</div>\n				</div>\n\n\n			</div>\n\n		</div>\n	</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"superbthemes_product_landingpage_pagespeed_section\">\n	<div class=\"content-wrap\">\n		<div class=\"superbthemes_product_landingpage_pagespeed_section_intro\">\n			<h2>Optimized for Speed & Search Engines</h2>\n			<p>Experience the most user-friendly & SEO-optimized themes and plugins that’ll help you rank #1 on Google and get visitors easily.\n			</p>\n		</div>\n		<div class=\"superbthemes_product_landingpage_pagespeed_section_stats\">\n\n\n\n			<div class=\"superbthemes_product_landingpage_pagespeed_section_stats_item\">\n				<h3>100%</h3>\n				<p>Speed Grade</p>\n				<div>\n					<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/pingdom-logo.png\" width=\"117\" height=\"24\" alt=\"Pingdom Logo\">\n				</div>\n			</div>\n\n			<div class=\"superbthemes_product_landingpage_pagespeed_section_stats_item\">\n				<h3>100%</h3>\n				<p>Performance</p>\n				<div>\n					<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/pagespeed-insight-logo.png\" width=\"160\" height=\"24\" alt=\"Google Insight Logo\">\n				</div>\n			</div>\n\n			<div class=\"superbthemes_product_landingpage_pagespeed_section_stats_item\">\n				<h3>0.3ms</h3>\n				<p>Load Time</p>\n				<div>\n					<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/gtmetrix-logo.png\" width=\"86\" height=\"24\" alt=\"GT Metrix Logo\">\n				</div>\n			</div>\n\n\n		</div>\n	</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"superbthemes-editor-features-section\">\n        <div class=\"content-wrap\">\n\n            <div class=\"superbthemes-editor-features-section-header text-center\">\n                <h2>Advanced Features</h2>\n                <p>Discover the advanced features of SuperbThemes that let you customize your WordPress site in ways no other plugin can.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"superbthemes-editor-features-section-feature-grid\">\n\n                <div class=\"superbthemes-editor-features-section-feature-grid-item\">\n                    <div class=\"superbthemes-editor-features-section-feature-grid-item-content\">\n                        <h3>Editor Highlights</h3>\n                        <p>Unlock the enhanced editor experience with grid systems, improved block control, and much more.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"superbthemes-editor-features-section-feature-grid-item\">\n                    <div class=\"superbthemes-editor-features-section-feature-grid-item-content\">\n                        <h3>Advanced Custom CSS</h3>\n                        <p>Add custom CSS to your website with syntax highlighting, custom display settings, and minified output.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"superbthemes-editor-features-section-feature-grid-item\">\n                    <div class=\"superbthemes-editor-features-section-feature-grid-item-content\">\n                        <h3>Responsive Block Control</h3>\n                        <p>Our premium block control feature allows you to easily hide or show any blocks on desktop, tablet or mobile.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n	<!-- Recommended Section Start -->\n	<div class=\"recommended_by_section_wrapper text-center\">\n		<div class=\"content-wrap\">\n			<h2>Recommended by</h2>\n			<P>We are proud that the following brands recommend our products.</P>\n\n			<div class=\"recommended_by_items_wrapper\">\n				<div class=\"recommended_by_item\">\n					<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/wp-rocket-logo.png\" alt=\"Recommended by WP Rocket\" width=\"198\" height=\"60\">\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"recommended_by_item\">\n					<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/smashing-icon.png\" alt=\"Recommended by Smashing Magazine\" width=\"198\" height=\"60\">\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"recommended_by_item\">\n					<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/wpbeginner.png\" alt=\"Recommended by WP Beginner\" width=\"198\" height=\"60\">\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"recommended_by_item\">\n					<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/hubspot-logo-1.png\" alt=\"Recommended by Hubspot\" width=\"198\" height=\"60\">\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"recommended_by_item\">\n					<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/wealthy-affiliates-logo.png\" alt=\"Recommended by Wealthy Affiliates\" width=\"198\" height=\"60\">\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"recommended_by_item\">\n					<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/codeinwp-logo.png\" alt=\"Recommended by Code In WP\" width=\"198\" height=\"60\">\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"recommended_by_item\">\n					<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/ionos.png\" alt=\"Recommended by Ionos\" width=\"198\" height=\"60\">\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"recommended_by_item\">\n					<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/pcmag.png\" alt=\"Mentioned PCmag.com\" width=\"198\" height=\"60\">\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"recommended_by_item\">\n					<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/one-com.png\" alt=\"Recommended by One.com\" width=\"198\" height=\"60\">\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"recommended_by_item\">\n					<img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/amp-logo-1.png\" alt=\"Recommended by Google AMP\" width=\"198\" height=\"60\">\n				</div>\n			</div>\n\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<!-- Recommended Section End-->  \n		<!-- Featured Themes Section Start -->\n\n	<div class=\"superbthemes_theme_collection superbthemes_theme_collection_featured\">\n		<div class=\"content-wrap\">\n			<h2>Popular WordPress Themes</h2>\n			<p>All of our themes are search-engine optimized & have an unmatchable page speed. Amazing customer support is our #1 priority.</p>\n\n\n			<div class=\"theme_collection_wrapper\">\n\n									<!-- Theme collection item start -->\n					<a class=\"theme_collection_item\" href=\"https://superbthemes.com/sonoran/\">\n						<div class=\"theme_collection_item-header\">\n							<img width=\"40\" height=\"8\" src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/img/browser-dots-icon.svg\" alt=\"Browser Dots Icon\">\n						</div>\n						<div class=\"theme_collection_item-body\">\n							<img width=\"372\" height=\"439\" src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/sonoran-preview-min-1.png\" alt=\"Theme Preview\">\n						</div>\n						<div class=\"theme_collection_item-footer\">\n							<span>Sonoran</span>\n						</div>\n					</a>\n									<!-- Theme collection item start -->\n					<a class=\"theme_collection_item\" href=\"https://superbthemes.com/minimalistix/\">\n						<div class=\"theme_collection_item-header\">\n							<img width=\"40\" height=\"8\" src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/img/browser-dots-icon.svg\" alt=\"Browser Dots Icon\">\n						</div>\n						<div class=\"theme_collection_item-body\">\n							<img width=\"372\" height=\"439\" src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/minimalix-preview-min.png\" alt=\"Theme Preview\">\n						</div>\n						<div class=\"theme_collection_item-footer\">\n							<span>Minimalistix</span>\n						</div>\n					</a>\n									<!-- Theme collection item start -->\n					<a class=\"theme_collection_item\" href=\"https://superbthemes.com/ruby-ecommerce/\">\n						<div class=\"theme_collection_item-header\">\n							<img width=\"40\" height=\"8\" src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/img/browser-dots-icon.svg\" alt=\"Browser Dots Icon\">\n						</div>\n						<div class=\"theme_collection_item-body\">\n							<img width=\"372\" height=\"439\" src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/ruby-ecommerce-preview-min.jpg\" alt=\"Theme Preview\">\n						</div>\n						<div class=\"theme_collection_item-footer\">\n							<span>Ruby eCommerce</span>\n						</div>\n					</a>\n				\n			</div>\n\n			<a href=\"https://superbthemes.com/wordpress-themes/\" class=\"superb_cta\">View All Themes</a>\n\n		</div>\n	</div>\n\n\n	<!-- Featured Themes Section End-->  \n	\n\n	<div class=\"superb_header_wrapper superb_header_frontpage_temporary_purchase superb_header_homepage superb_header_headline_length_medium\" style=\"display:block;\">\n		<div class=\"content-wrap\">\n			<div class=\"superbthemes_header_center_countdown_section\">\n				<h2>Limited-Time Offer: Up To 50% Discount on All Pricing Plans!</h2>\n				<div class=\"superb_header_frontpage_temporary_purchase_tagline\">Use the <span>50% discount</span> and launch your website today</div>\n				<ul class=\"superb_header_frontpage_temporary_purchase_list\">\n					<li><img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/img/check-bold-green.svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" alt=\"Checkmark\"> <span>Unlock all premium features and products</span></li>\n					<li><img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/img/check-bold-green.svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" alt=\"Checkmark\"> <span>Build any kind of website easily</span></li>\n					<li><img src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/img/check-bold-green.svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" alt=\"Checkmark\"> <span>Customer support 7 days a week</span></li>\n				</ul>\n\n				<div class=\"superb_header_frontpage_temporary_purchase_countdown_cta_wrapper\">\n					<div class=\"superb_header_frontpage_temporary_purchase_countdown_wrapper\">\n						<div class=\"superb_header_frontpage_temporary_purchase_countdown_wrapper_days\">0 <span>Days</span></div>\n						<span class=\"superb_discount_bar_countdown_value superb_header_frontpage_temporary_purchase_countdown_inner\"></span>\n					</div>\n					<a class=\"superb_header_frontpage_temporary_purchase_countdown_cta_button\" href=\"https://superbthemes.com/pricing/\">GET 50% OFF TODAY</a>\n					<div class=\"superb_header_frontpage_temporary_purchase_countdown_cta_button-refund-policy\">14-Day Money-Back Guarantee</div>\n				</div>\n			</div>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div><!-- #content -->\n\n<footer id=\"colophon\" class=\"site-footer clearfix\">\n\n	<div class=\"content-wrap\">\n		<div class=\"footer-grid-four superbthemes-footer-grid\">\n			<div class=\"footer-grid-item\">\n				<div class=\"footer-logo\">\n					<img width=\"139\" height=\"25\" src=\"https://superbthemes.com/wp-content/themes/lifestylepress/superb-white.svg\" alt=\"SuperbThemes\">\n				</div>\n				<p>Build any kind of website easily. <br>The last WordPress products you’ll ever need. Finally.</p>\n				<label class=\"footer-newsletter-trigger superbthemes-footer-newsletter-trigger newsletter-activate-btn newsletter-popup-btn superb_cta\" for=\"newsletter-modal\">Join our newsletter</label>\n\n\n			</div>\n\n			<div class=\"footer-grid-item\">\n				<h3>Products</h3>\n				<ul>\n					<li><a href=\"https://superbthemes.com/products/\">All WordPress Products</a></l', 'off');
